WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.710 --> 00:00:03.753
I didn't want to be gay,

00:00:03.837 --> 00:00:07.280
and the main voices in my head
were just telling me,

00:00:07.465 --> 00:00:09.479
"You'll get through this,
you'll get through this."

00:00:10.593 --> 00:00:14.013
You have been on The Bachelor.
You have played football.

00:00:14.097 --> 00:00:16.308
I want to be a man of faith.

00:00:16.866 --> 00:00:19.562
But that doesn't identify
who you are.

00:00:20.883 --> 00:00:22.208
Never thought
I was gonna come out.

00:00:22.258 --> 00:00:23.959
I thought I was gonna die
with this secret.

00:00:24.192 --> 00:00:26.693
The reason I'm coming out
is because I'm ashamed

00:00:26.777 --> 00:00:27.987
and I'm sort of mortified

00:00:28.070 --> 00:00:30.738
of what got me into this position
in the first place.

00:00:31.657 --> 00:00:34.785
I put a poor girl through hell
of my own insecurities.

00:00:35.071 --> 00:00:37.830
Cassie filed a restraining order
against you. You went off the rails.

00:00:37.913 --> 00:00:40.679
I was starting to hurt other people
outside of just myself.

00:00:40.754 --> 00:00:43.418
You want to sit down and apologize
to make yourself feel better.

00:00:43.502 --> 00:00:46.255
The best thing you can do
is face up to what you've done

00:00:46.583 --> 00:00:49.391
and find out who the hell you are.

00:00:49.916 --> 00:00:52.270
I only have one life.
Something's gotta change.

00:00:52.345 --> 00:00:55.722
The thought of even telling my dad
makes me anxious and nervous.

00:00:55.805 --> 00:00:59.183
If you come out, you give him
the opportunity to really know you.

00:00:59.268 --> 00:01:02.353
I backed myself into a corner
running from who I am.

00:01:02.437 --> 00:01:04.482
Basically, what I'm trying
to tell you is I'm gay.

00:01:05.315 --> 00:01:09.528
It always hurt more when I heard
coaches make comments or jokes.

00:01:09.612 --> 00:01:11.322
Were you ever worried
about the coaches?

00:01:11.405 --> 00:01:13.417
Yeah, they were like
father figures to me.

00:01:13.725 --> 00:01:17.368
How am I supposed to be
a football player and be gay?

00:01:17.452 --> 00:01:18.328
I still love you.

00:01:18.412 --> 00:01:19.622
You downloaded Grindr yet?

00:01:20.247 --> 00:01:21.290
You're a little shit.

00:01:23.137 --> 00:01:24.635
What do you want out of a relationship?

00:01:24.712 --> 00:01:27.672
An emotional connection.
I've never had one with a man.

00:01:27.755 --> 00:01:29.882
You still a gay in training. It's okay.

00:01:29.965 --> 00:01:31.592
I don't know what to do
with my hands.

00:01:31.675 --> 00:01:32.817
Am I looking too long?

00:01:32.927 --> 00:01:36.179
Try and shed any expectation
of what you're supposed to do

00:01:36.254 --> 00:01:37.347
and just be you.

00:01:38.295 --> 00:01:40.142
What you put her through
was bullshit.

00:01:40.758 --> 00:01:42.937
It takes honesty and vulnerability.

00:01:43.784 --> 00:01:45.524
I don't have to have
a secret anymore.

00:01:45.599 --> 00:01:47.315
-The smile is real.
-Colton!

00:01:47.398 --> 00:01:50.027
Since confronting it,
this is the best I've ever felt.

00:01:50.110 --> 00:01:52.863
Everybody's coming out stories
are different.

00:01:53.383 --> 00:01:56.950
And I'm grateful to be able to add
my story to the conversation.

00:02:00.037 --> 00:02:02.915
If you're really worried about
what other people are gonna say,

00:02:02.998 --> 00:02:05.083
then reconsider these jeans.

00:02:05.158 --> 00:02:06.668
They're so trash.

